    "text": "<p>Match List I with List II</p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>List-I (Polymer)</strong></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>List-II (Nature)</strong></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>A</td>\t\t\t<td>\t\t\t<p><img src=\"assets\\qt0012_d529ae2264a0.png\" style=\"width: 195px; height: 100px;\" /></p>\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t<td>I</td>\t\t\t<td>Thermosetting polymer</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>B</td>\t\t\t<td>\t\t\t<p><img src=\"assets\\qt0012_6e5ef9849216.png\" style=\"width: 281px; height: 100px;\" /></p>\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t<td>II</td>\t\t\t<td>Fibers</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>C</td>\t\t\t<td>\t\t\t<p><img src=\"assets\\qt0012_7ffbc8c2d5b2.png\" style=\"width: 119px; height: 100px;\" /></p>\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t<td>III</td>\t\t\t<td>Elastomer</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>D</td>\t\t\t<td>\t\t\t<p><img src=\"assets\\qt0012_96e27b3b380f.png\" style=\"width: 242px; height: 100px;\" /></p>\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t<td>IV</td>\t\t\t<td>Thermoplastic polymer</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><p>Choose the correct answer from the options given below</p>"
